{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "description": "GUISE event/cutscene with JSON-timed audio cues and screen-owned audio handoff.",
  "routes": {
    "onBoot": "boot_intro",
    "onNewGame": null
  },
  "screens": {
    "main_title": "MenuAnimationTestScreen"
  },
  "events": {
    "boot_intro": {
      "kind": "cutscene",
      "tags": [
        "boot",
        "opening",
        "cinematic",
        "prophecy"
      ],
      "skippable": false,
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "opening_black",
          "type": "wait",
          "tags": [
            "boot",
            "black_screen"
          ],
          "seconds": 0.55
        },
        {
          "id": "company_splash",
          "type": "image",
          "tags": [
            "boot",
            "branding",
            "company_logo"
          ],
          "asset": "menu/title/COMPANY LOGO.png",
          "widthRatio": 0.55,
          "maxHeightRatio": 0.38,
          "fadeInSeconds": 1.05,
          "holdSeconds": 1.45,
          "fadeOutSeconds": 0.9,
          "blackSeconds": 0.25,
          "audioCues": [
            {
              "at": "start",
              "offsetSeconds": 0.0,
              "action": "play",
              "track": "company_crash"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "prophecy_01",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "tags": [
            "prophecy",
            "narration",
            "groove",
            "opening"
          ],
          "lines": [
            "Hark, Cool Cats and Groovin’ bands,",
            "for I bear witness to the dawn of destruction",
            "awaiting the GROOVE."
          ],
          "font": "fonts/Post Antiqua BE Regular.ttf",
          "textColor": "#EDE4D5",
          "fontSizeRatio": 0.047,
          "lineSpacingMultiplier": 1.35,
          "maxTextWidthRatio": 0.86,
          "fadeInSeconds": 0.95,
          "holdSeconds": 5.6,
          "fadeOutSeconds": 0.9,
          "blackSeconds": 0.22,
          "audioCues": [
            {
              "at": "start",
              "action": "play",
              "track": "prophecy_wind"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "prophecy_02",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "tags": [
            "prophecy",
            "narration",
            "eternal_drum",
            "dukes_kings_counts"
          ],
          "lines": [
            "When the eternal drum resounds throughout the earth,",
            "the Dukes, the Kings, and the Counts will stop jammin’."
          ],
          "font": "fonts/Post Antiqua BE Regular.ttf",
          "textColor": "#EDE4D5",
          "fontSizeRatio": 0.047,
          "lineSpacingMultiplier": 1.35,
          "maxTextWidthRatio": 0.86,
          "fadeInSeconds": 0.95,
          "holdSeconds": 5.7,
          "fadeOutSeconds": 0.9,
          "blackSeconds": 0.22
        },
        {
          "id": "prophecy_03",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "tags": [
            "prophecy",
            "narration",
            "jam",
            "catastrophe"
          ],
          "lines": [
            "The GROOVE will slow;",
            "the urge to JAM will overpower the will of the masses,",
            "marking the beginning of the end."
          ],
          "font": "fonts/Post Antiqua BE Regular.ttf",
          "textColor": "#EDE4D5",
          "fontSizeRatio": 0.047,
          "lineSpacingMultiplier": 1.35,
          "maxTextWidthRatio": 0.86,
          "fadeInSeconds": 0.95,
          "holdSeconds": 6.4,
          "fadeOutSeconds": 0.9,
          "blackSeconds": 0.22
        },
        {
          "id": "prophecy_04",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "tags": [
            "prophecy",
            "narration",
            "groove_merchant",
            "song_of_his_soul",
            "law_of_rhythm"
          ],
          "lines": [
            "And lo, those who behold this great mystery",
            "shall stand before the GROOVE MERCHANT",
            "and perform the SONG OF HIS SOUL;",
            "such is the Law of RHYTHM."
          ],
          "font": "fonts/Post Antiqua BE Regular.ttf",
          "textColor": "#EDE4D5",
          "fontSizeRatio": 0.047,
          "lineSpacingMultiplier": 1.35,
          "maxTextWidthRatio": 0.86,
          "fadeInSeconds": 0.95,
          "holdSeconds": 7.1,
          "fadeOutSeconds": 0.9,
          "blackSeconds": 0.22
        },
        {
          "id": "prophecy_05",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "tags": [
            "prophecy",
            "narration",
            "closing"
          ],
          "lines": [
            "...So it is written"
          ],
          "font": "fonts/Post Antiqua BE Regular.ttf",
          "textColor": "#EDE4D5",
          "fontSizeRatio": 0.047,
          "lineSpacingMultiplier": 1.35,
          "maxTextWidthRatio": 0.86,
          "fadeInSeconds": 0.95,
          "holdSeconds": 2.4,
          "fadeOutSeconds": 0.9,
          "blackSeconds": 0.22,
          "audioCues": [
            {
              "at": "fadeOutStart",
              "action": "fade",
              "track": "prophecy_wind",
              "toVolume": 0.0,
              "durationSeconds": 0.9
            },
            {
              "at": "end",
              "action": "stop",
              "track": "prophecy_wind"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "groove_logo_reveal",
          "type": "logo_reveal",
          "tags": [
            "boot",
            "groove_logo",
            "title_transition"
          ],
          "asset": "menu/title/GROOVE_LOGO.png",
          "fadeInSeconds": 1.0,
          "holdSeconds": 3.0,
          "slideSeconds": 1.15,
          "flashSeconds": 0.2,
          "audioCues": [
            {
              "at": "flashStart",
              "action": "play",
              "track": "flash_thunder"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "enter_title",
          "type": "open_screen",
          "tags": [
            "navigation",
            "title"
          ],
          "screenId": "main_title",
          "audioCues": [
            {
              "at": "start",
              "action": "play",
              "track": "city_ambience"
            },
            {
              "at": "start",
              "action": "play",
              "track": "main_menu_theme"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "audio": {
    "company_crash": {
      "file": "menu/sound/cymbal-crash-sound-effect.mp3",
      "type": "sound",
      "volume": 0.8
    },
    "prophecy_wind": {
      "file": "menu/sound/Howling Wind Sound Effect.mp3",
      "type": "music",
      "volume": 0.42,
      "loop": true
    },
    "flash_thunder": {
      "file": "menu/sound/Thunder Sound effect.mp3",
